  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往亚留特村外（527~546.35~39）处附近寻找黄色传送石，进入后抵达奇怪的洞窟。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆奇怪的洞窟为随机迷宫，随机10-12层",
      "type": "maze-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "迷宫刷新时间：4小时（仅供参考），地图大小范围：60*60；宝箱数量：6",
      "type": "maze-metadata",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "魔物为Lv16~19的地狱看门犬、僵尸、腐尸，最高遇敌数量8",
      "type": "maze-encounter",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "Lv16~19地狱看门犬，血量约400，野兽系，属性：火60水40，不抗咒；技能：攻击、防御、连击",
      "type": "enemy-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "Lv16~19僵尸，血量约400，不死系，属性：地40风60，不抗咒；技能：攻击、诸刃、什么都不做、攻击（敌方随机；低几率）",
      "type": "enemy-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "Lv16~19腐尸，血量约450，不死系，属性：地60水40，不抗咒；技能：攻击、防御、酒醉攻击",
      "type": "enemy-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "2.在奇怪的洞窟内寻找随机出现的无照护士米内鲁帕并与之对话，获得【实验药】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "◆【实验药】全队都需持有，否则无法进入最终的BOSS战",
      "type": "party-item-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "◆持有【牢房的钥匙】时，无法获得【实验药】",
      "type": "item-block",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "3.抵达迷宫底层寻找到上楼的楼梯，进入后抵达阿鲁巴斯实验所。",
      "type": "route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "4.持有【实验药】与改造僵尸（21.18）对话进入战斗，同时交出【实验药】。",
      "type": "party-exchange-battle",
